7. HONESTY, NOT ENFORCEMENT

7.1  The Software runs entirely on your own hardware. It contains no licence
     key check, no usage metering, no activation and no telemetry. It does not
     contact us, and it does not report what you process. This is deliberate:
     it is what makes the Software trustworthy for the people using it for
     free.

7.2  Compliance with the allowances in clause 2.1 therefore rests on you. We
     have chosen to trust our users rather than police them. If the Software is
     worth more to you than the limit allows, the fee is small and paying it is
     how this continues to exist.


